# ============================================================================
# Supabase Edge Functions environment.
# Locally, `supabase functions serve` injects SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY automatically — you do NOT set them here.
#
# Leave Stripe keys unset to run in MOCK payment mode (the default, free, local).
# Add them to switch payments to real Stripe. See INTEGRATIONS.md §4.
# ============================================================================

# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...            # PLACEHOLDER — add when you have Stripe
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...          # PLACEHOLDER — add when you have Stripe (from `stripe listen` or the dashboard)
# STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...       # PLACEHOLDER — returned to the client to init Payment Element/Sheet
